#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * AURA — voice commands: "Hey AURA, next song"
 *
 *   Settings > Voice Commands (off until you switch it on). Say "Hey AURA", then:
 *   next song, pause, play, volume up/down, mute · start/stop recording · show the bar ·
 *   open library/clips/media/messages/settings/home · launch <a game in your library>.
 *   Uses the speech recognition built into Windows, on your PC: free, offline, nothing recorded.
 *   Music commands control AURA's player, or whatever plays on your PC if AURA's player is empty.
 *   The privacy policy gets a "Voice commands" section.
 *
 * How to use:  node aura-voice-setup.cjs      (in your AURA project folder)
 * To undo:     node aura-voice-setup.cjs --undo
 */
